# The talking update: private tells a bot starts with the player (kind tell). Every tell is an opener and says
# what it invites. {player} and {place} come from the bot's memory, so those lines need knows_player.
# A tell never promises what the server will not do (inviting, giving, coming over). New writing (see docs/bot-voices).

# ---- hello_friend: a bot that knows the player sees them log in or come near ----
@kind tell
@topic hello_friend
@who *
@needs knows_player
@invites chat
hey {player}, back for more?
oh hey {player}, saw you log in
heya {player}
yo {player}
hi {player}! good timing, its been quiet
hey {player}, i was just thinking about our last group
@invites ask
{player}! where have you been hiding?
hey {player}, long time, how are things?
hi {player}, what are you up to tonight?
{player}, hey! long day?
@needs knows_player,player_leveling
{player} hi, how is the leveling going?
hey {player}, dinged yet?
@needs knows_player
@needs knows_player,evening
@invites chat
evening {player}, good to see a friendly name on
@needs knows_player,player_nearby
hey {player}, didnt know you were around here
@needs knows_player
@who Socialite
{player}!! hiii, missed you
@who NoLifer
@invites ask
there you are {player}, thought you quit on us

# ---- after_group: grouped with the player before ----
@kind tell
@topic after_group
@who *
@needs knows_player
@invites chat
ty for the group the other night
hey, ty again for the group at {place}
{player}, that group at {place} was fun, ty
hey {player}, good group last time, ty
ty for sticking around last group, i know it ran long
that was the best xp i had all week, ty {player}
sorry i had to leave the group early last time
{player}, we made a good team at {place}
@invites ask
hey {player}, want to run {place} again sometime?
@who Leveler
still riding the xp from that group at {place}, ty

# ---- group_offer: close in level, same zone ----
@kind tell
@topic group_offer
@who *
@needs !knows_player
@invites ask
hey, want to duo here? im {level} {class}
{level} {class} here, want to team up for a bit?
you looking for a group? im {level}, same area
we keep going after the same mobs lol, want to group?
want to group? xp is better with two
hey, saw you soloing, duo?
your level looks close to mine, want to group up?
hey, im {level}, you?
lfg? i could use a partner out here
@needs !knows_player,outdoors
hi, im {level} {class}, want to duo in {zone}?
@needs !knows_player,is_healer
duo? i can heal, you hit things
@needs !knows_player,is_tank
want a tank? im {level} {class}, you pull i hold
@needs !knows_player,is_caster
duo? im a {class}, lots of damage but squishy
@needs knows_player
hey {player}, same zone again, want to group?
@needs knows_player,outdoors
{player}, im in {zone} too, duo?

# ---- help_offer: the player is a low level near the bot ----
@kind tell
@topic help_offer
@who *
@needs knows_player
@invites ask
hey {player}, need a hand with anything?
{player}, need help with that quest?
hey {player}, how is it going? need anything?
need directions anywhere {player}?
any questions about your class? happy to help
{player}, you doing ok? lots of things wander through here
hey {player}, saw you fighting, all good?
@invites chat
if you get stuck, send me a tell
hey, remember to train when you ding
@needs knows_player,outdoors
watch the adds around here, they hit hard at your level

# ---- news_tell: shares news privately (the news flag supplies the slots) ----
@kind tell
@topic news_tell
@who *
@invites ask
@needs keep_lost_recent,knows_player
did you see we lost {keep}?
@invites chat
@needs keep_lost_recent,knows_player
{player}, {keep} fell, if you want some rp tonight
@invites ask
@needs keep_won_recent,knows_player
hey, we took {keep}! you see it?
@invites chat
@needs relic_lost_recent,knows_player
psst, {relic} is gone, they got it
@needs relic_won_recent,knows_player
{player}! we took {relic}
@invites ask
@needs raid_won_recent,knows_player
did you hear the raid killed {boss} in {raid}?
@invites chat
@needs raid_wiped_recent,knows_player
raid wiped on {boss}, glad you werent there lol
@needs defending,knows_player
hey, {keep} is under attack if you feel like a fight
@needs attacking,knows_player
{player}, the army is hitting {keep}, free rp
@needs keep_news,knows_player
{keep} changed hands, frontier is busy tonight
@invites ask
you hear about {keep}? keeps are flipping all over
@about place
@needs df_changed_recent,df_ours,knows_player
@invites ask
df is ours again, want to go?
@needs df_changed_recent,!df_ours,knows_player
@invites chat
heads up, we lost df
@about

# ---- guildmate: small talk with a guildmate ----
@kind tell
@topic guildmate
@who *
@needs knows_player
@invites ask
hey, anyone in the guild grouping tonight?
{player}, are we doing anything this weekend?
yo, got a question about your spec, got a sec?
hey, you ok? havent seen you on much
{player}! guild is quiet tonight, where is everyone?
@needs knows_player,player_leveling
{player}, how close are you to your next level?
{player}, quick question, what armor are you wearing at your level?
@needs knows_player
@invites chat
heya guildie
{player}, we should get the guild out to rvr soon
was just telling the others about you lol, all good things
@who Crafter
@invites ask
need anything made? i have some free time at the forge
@who Socialite
@invites chat
we miss you in /gu, say hi sometime
@who Leveler
@invites ask
@needs knows_player,player_leveling
{player}, want to level together some night this week?
@needs knows_player
@who NoLifer
@invites chat
guild needs more people in the frontier, think about it
